check 1
# replay-diff session (specs/tools/replay-diff.md): 10,000 frames (400 s of
# game time) of town play in the Rogue Encampment, ScnAma (level 1 amazon),
# seed 1234. Before frame 4 the game seed is fixed and five items are put on
# the ground next to the player (as items-ground-pokes); the input picks them
# up (clickunit 4 *), walks toward the waypoint (object class 119), clicks it
# and walks away (no ESC: with no panel open it opens the single-player menu,
# which pauses 1.14d), then walks (run toggled with R), talks to the nearest
# NPC (clickunit 1 *) and walks away, revisits the waypoint. 1.14d plays
# the input; d2rs gets the C->S messages 1.14d sent, frame by frame.
# Input generated once by a fixed LCG (seed 1370) walk over the screen.
name town-ama-10k
save ScnAma --class ama --expansion
seed 1234
ticks 10000
seconds 7000
at 4 poke seed-game 0x00001234 666
at 4 poke item hp1 @x+2 @y
at 4 poke item cap @x+3 @y quality magic ilvl 30
at 4 poke item gld @x+2 @y+2
at 4 poke item lea @x+3 @y+2 quality rare ilvl 40
at 4 poke item r05 @x+4 @y+2
input frame 12; key R; frame 20; clickunit 4 *; frame 70; clickunit 4 *; frame 120; clickunit 4 *
input+ frame 170; clickunit 4 *; frame 220; clickunit 4 *; frame 270; click 700 200; frame 320; click 700 200
input+ frame 370; clickunit 2 119; frame 470; click 150 450; frame 520; click 244 244; frame 565; click 197 273
